flowchart TD
  Welcome[Welcome / sample lesson] --> Account[Account or continue sample]
  Account --> Setup[Goal / topic / language / comfort / teacher]
  Setup --> Home[Home]
  Home --> Material[Choose material]
  Material --> Review[Review text against original page]
  Review --> Revision[Save reviewed revision]
  Revision --> Plan[Choose lesson goal and form]
  Plan --> Teach[Learn with Rain or reading view]
  Teach --> Ask[Tap anchor / type / optional push-to-talk]
  Ask --> Cite[Source-backed answer or smaller hint]
  Cite --> Teach
  Teach --> Stop[I'm stuck: cancel audio / mouth / queued gestures]
  Stop --> Cite
  Teach --> Practise[Try a task and explain]
  Practise --> Feedback[Rubric feedback and assistance labels]
  Feedback --> Evidence[Keep work with source and revision]
  Evidence --> Direction[Role requirements and explained evidence gaps]
  Direction --> Project[Specific project / learning path]
  Project --> Practise
  Direction --> CV[Truthful CV and portfolio]
  CV --> Opportunity[Review original opportunity and freshness]
  Opportunity --> Draft[Prepare draft / review recipient and contents]
  Draft --> Consent{Exact external action approved?}
  Consent -->|No| Draft
  Consent -->|Yes, future live feature| Submit[Bounded submission and verified result]
  Home --> Settings[Teacher / access / data / memory / privacy]
  Settings --> Offline[Choose and verify reading downloads]
  Teach -->|Connection unavailable| Offline
  Offline --> Reading[Saved reading and notes]
  Reading -->|Reconnect| Reconcile[Reconcile versions / ask before replacement]
  Reconcile --> Home
